1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
I can't believe I'm actually standing up here.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.000
A lowly servant in the Dragon Knight Trials.

3
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Beatrix is the Royal Academy's golden girl.

4
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Lucian is the heir ascent.

5
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The Four Orders have already thrown their gates wide open for them.

6
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.000
This trial is just a victory ramp.

7
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
If you ask me, the real center of attention today, isn't those two prodigies?

8
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
It's the Eren Boy, wrapped in dirty rags.

9
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.000
The rules are absolute.

10
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Bleed onto the Pestil Sensor Crystal.

11
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Igniting a rune proves your aptitude to Commander Dragon of that element.

12
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Ignite at least one rune and you earn the right to be a standard Dragon Knight.

13
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Ignite two and the gates of the Four Orders will open for you.

14
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Three or more, you earn the right to become the next commander of an order.

15
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.000
That is the privilege of a true prodigy.

16
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Great.

17
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:54.000
My completely average dead-end life is about to be laid bare under the Dragon Gods watch.

18
00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.000
Our generation's absolute peak sits right here.

19
00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.000
Grand Duke Vane ignited six runes.

20
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:01.000
A historic anomaly, of course.

21
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:03.000
Spare me the ancient history.

22
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:05.000
My little achievements are nothing to brag about.

23
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:09.000
Legend says only the Dragon Gods chosen can ignite all twelve runes at once.

24
00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:11.000
It means the Rider and Dragon share a single soul.

25
00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:13.000
They could command the entire Dragon race.

26
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:15.000
But let's be real, that's just a fairy tale.

27
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:17.000
Twelve runes?

28
00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:20.000
A guy like that could squash me with his pinky.

29
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:24.000
Since Aris was granted a special exception

30
00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:29.000
and brought such a unique companion, why don't we start with you?

31
00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:33.000
Let's show everyone just how incredible you really are.
